{
  "description": "Docs gap: R2 Local Uploads (https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/buckets/local-uploads/) has no page in the Cloudflare API reference, nor in cloudflare/api-schemas or the official Cloudflare SDKs (checked 2026-10-21). Wrangler's `r2 bucket local-uploads get|enable|disable` call GET and PUT /accounts/{account_id}/r2/buckets/{bucket_name}/local-uploads; the PUT body is `{ \"enabled\": boolean }` and both answer `{ \"enabled\": boolean }` in the v4 envelope. Route and shapes transcribed from cloudflare/workers-sdk packages/wrangler/src/r2/helpers/local-uploads.ts and its tests (commit 253a85de5e). No cf-r2-jurisdiction header: Wrangler sends none, and the feature is unsupported on jurisdiction-restricted buckets. See alchemy-run/distilled#883.",
